  "rationale": "The batch contains repeated causal patterns that the current roots do not adequately support: an introductory preposition after a noun/name and paragraph break, adjectives after “In a” and “On a,” commas after introductory noun phrases, adverbs after a proper noun, “the” after “so,” and sentence-final periods after nouns or verbs. The proposed modest, context-conditioned output masses generalize these observed forms without using target-only information or asserting future story structure. Noun-final contexts are ambiguous and can also continue a sentence, and multiple adverbs or introductory prepositions may be valid; the punctuation and lexical boosts therefore remain limited rather than making alternatives impossible. No replay-gate result is assumed."
